<style>
/* Layout: sticky top bar, hero with generated key art, horizontal rails of tiles, detail sheet over a scrim. Single dark theme by design. */
:root{
  --bg:#0c0d12; --glass:#0c0d12e6; --surface:#161821; --surface-2:#20232e;
